From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LNPANDY <lnp-andy@hotmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 20:54:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] The layout editor: long-press the layout button and drag
 every control where it fits
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Each game is its own app, so its layout is its own: a long press on the layout button opens the editor, where every movable control (left stick, diamond, D-pad, shoulders, L3 / R3, − / +) shows a dashed outline to drag anywhere on screen; tapping the button saves and leaves, long-pressing it inside the editor resets every position. Positions are screen fractions in NSUserDefaults (DmPadCustom) and the built-in layout remains the fallback, so nothing moves until a player moves it. The editor holds no game input and the choice survives updates like the layout choice does.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Players ask to place the virtual controls themselves (the built-in corners do not fit every hand and game); the editor keeps the built-in layout as the fallback and stores positions per game
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple (owner request, virtual pad customization)
---
 dm/ios/Sources/DmGamepad.m | 126 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 115 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dm/ios/Sources/DmGamepad.m b/dm/ios/Sources/DmGamepad.m
